  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.5.1 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Features\n* ci(release): migrate Homebrew tap from brews to homebrew_casks by @AdamMagued in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/93\n### Other Changes\n* ci(release): replace artifacts when a release is re-run by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/90\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.59.0 to 1.60.1 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/92\n\n## New Contributors\n* @AdamMagued made their first contribution in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/93\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/compare/v0.5.0...v0.5.1\n\n",
